    <string name="alarm_title">Alert when out of range</string>
    <string name="alarm_desc">Above the range - 3 long buzzes, below - 4 short ones, repeated every 5 s until heart rate returns or \"Mute\" is pressed. Back in range - 1 short buzz. No data from the sensor for 15 s - long-short-long. Clears with a 3 bpm margin: with an upper limit of 100 it clears at 97.</string>
